+// ---- compute stage_in ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// A kernel with [[stage_in]] parameters (SceneKit's skin_var / morph kernels, Memoji) reads its vertex attributes through
+// the pipeline's MTLStageInputOutputDescriptor. The translator lowers every such parameter to a read-only storage buffer
